    "promptText": "Relative to a fixed origin O , the horizontal unit vectors i and j are pointing due east and due north, respectively. A ship A is moving with constant velocity. At noon A is at the point with position vector ( 12 i + 12 j km and at 2 p.m. it has ) sailed to the point with position vector ( 8 i + 20 j km . ) a) Determine the velocity of A . ( ) 3 b) Write down an expression for the position vector of A , t hours after noon. ( ) 2 A ship B is also moving with constant velocity and its position vector, r km , t hours after noon is given by r = ( 2 t + k ) i + ( 2 t + 33 ) j, where k is a scalar constant. c) Given that A intercepts B determine the value of k . ( ) 3"
